content.text:
```css
.dashboard {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
}
```

The three `1fr` values create three flexible columns that share the available grid space.

target.css:
.metric-grid { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 14px; background: #0f172a; border-radius: 10px; }
.metric-card { background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; color: #f8fafc; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
.label { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #94a3b8; }
.metric-card strong { font-size: 18px; color: #38bdf8; }

